{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And she became a pillar of salt.</b> In salt she sinned, as Rashi explained; therefore when she transgressed the angels' command, she was stricken with the affliction of Sodom. Another interpretation: <b>And his wife looked back from behind him and she became</b> — all the land a pillar of salt, for sulfur and salt burned up all its land."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:55.799711913Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}